  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "どうくつの　かべから　えいようぶんを　きゅうしゅう。どくの　けっしょうで　できたはなびらを　みにまとう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "동굴의 벽에서 영양분을 흡수한다. 독의 결정으로 만들어진 꽃잎을 몸에 두르고 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會從洞窟的壁上吸取養分。包覆在身上的花瓣是用毒的結晶做成的。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il absorbe les nutriments qui se trouvent dans les parois des grottes. Les pétales qui recouvrent son corps sont constitués de poison cristallisé.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es absorbiert Nährstoffe von Höhlenwänden und bedeckt seinen Körper mit Blütenblättern, die aus kristallisiertem Gift bestehen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Absorbe nutrientes de las paredes de las cuevas. Cubre su cuerpo con pétalos hechos de energía venenosa cristalizada.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Assorbe sostanze nutritive dalle pareti delle caverne. Il suo corpo è avvolto da petali composti da cristalli velenosi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It absorbs nutrients from cave walls. The petals it wears are made of crystallized poison.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "洞窟の　壁から　栄養分を　吸収。毒の　結晶で　できた花びらを　身にまとう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "从洞窟的壁上吸取营养。包覆在身上的花瓣是用毒所凝聚的结晶做成的。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Absorbe nutrientes de las paredes de las cuevas. Cubre su cuerpo con pétalos hechos de energía venenosa cristalizada.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "どくせいぶんの　けっしょうが　まるではなびらに　みえる。　かふんのようにどくのこなを　ばらまき　みをまもる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "독성분의 결정은 마치 꽃잎처럼 생겼다. 꽃가루처럼 독 가루를 흩뿌려서 몸을 보호한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "以毒構成的結晶看似花瓣。會如灑花粉般地灑出毒粉來保護自身安全。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ses cristaux nocifs ressemblent en tout point à des pétales. Il répand une poudre toxique semblable à du pollen pour se défendre.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Die giftigen Kristalle sehen echten Blütenblättern zum Verwechseln ähnlich. Es schützt sich, indem es einen pollenartigen Giftpuder verstreut.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus cristales tóxicos se asemejan a los pétalos de una flor. Se protege esparciendo un polvo venenoso como si de polen se tratara.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "I suoi cristalli di veleno sembrano in tutto e per tutto dei petali. Per proteggersi sparge polvere tossica come se fosse polline.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Glimmet’s toxic mineral crystals look just like flower petals. This Pokémon scatters poisonous powder like pollen to protect itself.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "毒成分の　結晶が　まるで花びらに　見える。　花粉のように毒の粉を　ばらまき　身を守る。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "成分为毒的结晶看起来就像是花瓣。会像撒花粉一样撒出毒粉来保护自身安全。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus cristales tóxicos se asemejan a los pétalos de una flor. Se protege esparciendo un polvo venenoso como si de polen se tratara.",
